# Windows Refactor Integration Plan

**Goal:** Receive the merged Windows HID and adapter-consistency work, then integrate it with the published Core audit while preserving both histories and their evidence.

**Architecture:** Use an isolated branch from the published audit tip and a two-parent merge of the pinned v2 upstream tip. Resolve code and documentation together at renamed/extracted ownership boundaries; retain frozen audit packets and source-specific platform evidence unchanged. Sol performs detailed intake, reconciliation and independent review; Astra adjudicates, integrates and executes validation.

**Tech Stack:** Git; .NET 10 / C# 14; the repository's `toolchain.cs`; Windows HID/BCL completion APIs, macOS IOKit, Linux hidraw and portable PC/SC adapters.

